Package: csvcap
Title: Instrument-Level Import of REDCap Projects from CSVs
Version: 0.0.0.9010
Authors@R: 
    person("Desi", "Quintans", , "science@desiquintans.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package provides tools for importing and working with
    REDCap projects that were exported using the "R Statistical Software"
    export format as a flat 'CSV' file.  It provides tools for fixing REDCap's 
	import script, separating instruments from each other, looking at the 
	structure of those instruments, and combining instruments that have 
	similar structures.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
